requirement SYS-MONITOR-SMAPLE-001
title: Acquire station samples
statement:
  The service shall acquire one complete station sample during each configured sampling interval.
end requirement

requirement SENSOR-LEVEL-001
title: Measure water level
statement:
  The level-sensing unit shall provide a water-level measurement with each station sample.
decomposes: SYS-MONITOR-SMAPLE-001
end requirement

requirement SENSOR-WEATHER-001
title: Measure weather conditions
statement:
  The weather-sensing unit shall provide precipitation and wind measurements with each station sample.
decomposes: SYS-MONITOR-SMAPLE-001
end requirement
